      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\left(\\sin\\left(\\frac{45}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)-\\cos\\left(\\frac{45}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)\\right)^2\n$$",
